# --- Rust ---
# 库（library）项目通常需要提交 Cargo.lock；二进制项目可取消下面注释
# Cargo.lock

# --- Go ---
# 若有意 vendor 依赖，请取消下面注释
# vendor/

# --- C# / .NET ---
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.tlog
.vs/
packages/
TestResults/

# --- 编译产物（可执行文件 / 动态库）---
*.exe
*.dll

